er 38 times since 1951, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 the middle ran 160% of normal in May to June but just 36% in September to October. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1954, with grid 14586 at 51% of normal. On grid 14887, the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 83.2.</p>"}
